सम्भव: सर्वभूतानां ततो भवति भारत ॥ ३ ॥\"}]},{\"section\":\"verse_text\",\"section_title\":\"Books.Verse.verse-text\",\"children\":[{\"type\":\"content.Record\",\"title\":\"verse_text\",\"id\":3839,\"bb\":3380,\"url_path\":\"/en/library/bg/14/3/b3380/\",\"body_value\":\"mama yonir mahad brahma
